<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>과제 제출 목록</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="topbar">
    <a href="/" class="brand">📚 과제함</a>
    <a href="/teacher/login" class="btn-secondary" style="font-size: 13px; padding: 6px 12px;">교사 로그인</a>
  </header>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>📚 학생 과제 제출 목록</h1>
      <p class="muted">제출할 과제를 선택한 후 파일을 제출해 주세요.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>진행 중인 과제</h2>
      <% if (assignments.length === 0) { %>
        <p class="muted">현재 등록된 과제가 없습니다.</p>
      <% } else { %>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0;">
          <% assignments.forEach(a => { %>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 15px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
              <div>
                <a href="/assignments/<%= a.id %>" style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; color: #2563eb;">
                  <%= a.title %>
                </a>
                <% if (a.due_date) { %>
                  <p class="muted" style="margin: 5px 0 0 0; font-size: 14px;">마감일: <%= a.due_date %></p>
                <% } %>
              </div>
              <a href="/assignments/<%= a.id %>" class="btn" style="margin: 0; padding: 8px 16px; font-size: 14px;">제출하기</a>
            </li>
          <% }) %>
        </ul>
      <% } %>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
